if mibBuilder.loadTexts: tmnxOamEthCfmPingCtlSrcMaIndex.setDescription('The value of tmnxOamEthCfmPingCtlSrcMaIndex specifies the source CFM\n         maintenance association index for the test.  Zero is the null CFM\n         maintenance association index.')
